@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:亚里沙的脸上<br>有一道疑似灼伤的<br>痕迹。|#0104Trial05_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:凑巧的是，<br>那痕迹看起来就像是<br>一只美丽的蝴蝶……|#0104Trial05_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但这个灼伤的形状，正是她的身体<br><link=\"Objection_01_04_05_01\">曾经通过电的证据</link>。<br>我记得这种痕迹好像叫做电击纹。|#0104Trial05_Margo003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不管有没有人<br>淋湿亚里沙……<br>她脸上的这道痕迹<br>就已经表明<br>她在电椅上<br>受过电刑。|#0104Trial05_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不过……<br>看着这个蝴蝶的形状，<br>就会让人想起<br>诺亚的尸体啊。|#0104Trial05_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……可可，<br>无关的事<br>能请你不要提吗。<br>我们现在要论证的是，<br>奈叶香是凶手这件事。|#0104Trial05_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR13,ArmL10,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:哈！？<br>只是发表个感想而已，<br>有什么关系嘛！|#0104Trial05_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
